        261.1356201171875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "overall usefulness of the index tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
