      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        84.66120147705078,
        312.1082763671875,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "the feasibility of implementing the index tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        100.16120147705078,
        379.3058166503906,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "the potential impact of the index tests on health equity; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        115.66120147705078,
        456.54638671875,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "how the potential impact of the index tests relates to current policy context.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.49981689453125,
        526.7940673828125,
        155.6448211669922
      ],
      "text": "Several important limitations of this approach were noted. Only a few participants were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.99981689453125,
        526.8037109375,
        171.1448211669922
      ],
      "text": "interviewed per country. Owing to the use of Zoom, Skype or phone for interviews, it was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.49981689453125,
        526.926025390625,
        186.6448211669922
      ],
      "text": "not possible to triangulate interview data with other evidence commonly collected through",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        188.99981689453125,
        526.7280883789062,
        202.1448211669922
      ],
      "text": "ethnographic approaches (e.g. multiple interviews and informal conversations at the same",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.49981689453125,
        526.6951293945312,
        217.6448211669922
      ],
      "text": "facility, observations or site visits). In addition, only some of the participants had personal",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.99981689453125,
        526.9039916992188,
        233.1448211669922
      ],
      "text": "experience with one or all of the index tests, and those participants who did have experience",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.49981689453125,
        467.8389892578125,
        248.6448211669922
      ],
      "text": "with the tests had used them in research settings rather than for routine practice.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.5037841796875,
        526.9595336914062,
        272.6488037109375
      ],
      "text": "More details on these interviews are given in  Web Annex B.14:  User perspectives on nucleic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.1907958984375,
        501.6421203613281,
        288.07177734375
      ],
      "text": "acid amplification tests for tuberculosis and tuberculosis drug resistance: Interviews study.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.5153503417969,
        316.37701416015625,
        316.89532470703125
      ],
      "text": "Findings of the review and interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.1462097167969,
        526.9844360351562,
        340.2912292480469
      ],
      "text": "The main findings of the systematic review and interviews are given below. Where information",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976123809814453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.6462097167969,
        526.96435546875,
        355.7912292480469
      ],
      "text": "is from the review, a level of confidence in the quality evidence synthesis (QES) is given; where",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1462097167969,
        333.6670837402344,
        371.2912292480469
      ],
      "text": "it is from interviews, this is indicated with ‘Interviews’.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.30419921875,
        527.1793212890625,
        395.21820068359375
      ],
      "text": "Is there important uncertainty about or variability in how much end-users value the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.80419921875,
        156.8860321044922,
        410.71820068359375
      ],
      "text": "main outcomes?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.65411376953125,
        78.81909942626953,
        434.79913330078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        421.65411376953125,
        286.8862609863281,
        434.79913330078125
      ],
      "text": "Patients in high burden TB settings value:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        437.15411376953125,
        95.91809844970703,
        450.29913330078125
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        437.15411376953125,
        526.9645385742188,
        450.29913330078125
      ],
      "text": "getting an accurate diagnosis and reaching diagnostic closure (finally knowing “what",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        452.65411376953125,
        200.093017578125,
        465.79913330078125
      ],
      "text": "is wrong with me”);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        468.15411376953125,
        95.91809844970703,
        481.29913330078125
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        468.15411376953125,
        527.2275390625,
        481.29913330078125
      ],
      "text": "avoiding diagnostic delays because they exacerbate existing financial hardships and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        483.65411376953125,
        526.9664306640625,
        496.79913330078125
      ],
      "text": "emotional and physical suffering, and make patients feel guilty for infecting others",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        499.15411376953125,
        203.29388427734375,
        512.2991333007812
      ],
      "text": "(especially children);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        514.6541137695312,
        95.91809844970703,
        527.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        514.6541137695312,
        255.20407104492188,
        527.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "having accessible facilities; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        530.1541137695312,
        95.91809844970703,
        543.2991333007812
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        530.1541137695312,
        526.9625244140625,
        543.2991333007812
      ],
      "text": "reducing diagnosis-associated costs (e.g. travel, missing work) as important outcomes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        545.6541137695312,
        189.09349060058594,
        558.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "of the diagnostic.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        561.3411254882812,
        231.66415405273438,
        574.2221069335938
      ],
      "text": "QES: moderate confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.4888305664062,
        78.81909942626953,
        592.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        579.4888305664062,
        526.9675903320312,
        592.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "Moderate complexity automated NAATs meet several preferences and values of clinicians",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        594.9888305664062,
        245.85720825195312,
        608.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "and laboratory staff, in that they:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        610.4888305664062,
        95.91809844970703,
        623.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        610.4888305664062,
        522.4205322265625,
        623.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "are faster than culture-based phenotypic DST (similar to LPA or cartridge-based tests);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        625.9888305664062,
        95.91809844970703,
        639.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        625.9888305664062,
        366.24517822265625,
        639.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "have the advantage of being automated (unlike LPA);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        641.4888305664062,
        95.91809844970703,
        654.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        641.4888305664062,
        526.68408203125,
        654.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "provide additional clinically relevant drug-resistance information such as high versus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        656.9888305664062,
        396.510009765625,
        670.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "low resistance (unlike the current Xpert MTB/RIF cartridge).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        672.6758422851562,
        153.39910888671875,
        685.5568237304688
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.6466674804688,
        305.39483642578125,
        709.5606689453125
      ],
      "text": "What would be the impact on health equity?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.49658203125,
        78.81909942626953,
        733.6416015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        720.49658203125,
        526.682861328125,
        733.6416015625
      ],
      "text": "Various factors – for example, lengthy diagnostic delays, underuse of diagnostics, lack",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        735.99658203125,
        527.0302734375,
        749.1416015625
      ],
      "text": "of TB diagnostic facilities at lower levels and too many eligibility restrictions – hamper",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        751.49658203125,
        526.96142578125,
        764.6416015625
      ],
      "text": "access to prompt and accurate testing and treatment, particularly for vulnerable groups.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        767.18359375,
        187.27345275878906,
        780.0645751953125
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 33",
